phs and thus learning the generative model is much more difficult. Figure 3 (in appendix A.1) shows the graph generative process of GRAPHARM and OA-ARM. As we can see, GRAPHARM first generates one community and then moves to another; while OA-ARM randomly generates the graph and fails to capture the underlying graph distribution."
